# NXR before raw builds

Discover the operation with `nxr list` or `nxr task`. Use that task for a check. Do not prepend `~/.cargo/bin` or `~/.rustup` to `PATH`.

A single compiler command that has already failed may run inside the flake shell.

Do not activate SYS-5, staging, or Hub 6420 from an automatic task. Fleet status is a read-only query of the live system.
